e doing pretty in terms Werewolfs maybe the Crotoan never die out or the <span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#404040\">Camazotz might never have <b>exterminated</b> and </span></span> the second war of rage might never have happened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":962,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/962-the-viking-anarch","user":"the viking anarch","date":". 02-25-2016, 04:13 PM 02-25-2016, 06:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/962-the-viking-anarch","name":"the viking anarch","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T03:23:58-08:00","id":836949,"title":"","content":"Check out The Man in the High Castle on Amazon Prime. It's about exactly that for general mortal population.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5767-deedee","name":"DeeDee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T04:39:04-08:00","id":836967,"title":"","content":"Maybe we would see a nuclear war betewen Germany and Soviet Union, with a phyrric victory...or the true winner would be a third faction who didn't suffer the wear by the wear. Maybe a lot of Asian people would travel to North and Sourth-america.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T16:22:37-08:00","id":837278,"title":"","content":"Provided that taking down the soviets wasn't a part of the &quot;axis winning the war&quot; set up to begin with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5767-deedee","name":"DeeDee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T21:23:21-08:00","id":837382,"title":"","content":"Well considering the Nephandi had come to heavily worm their way into the Nazis and where causing all kinds of havoc on Earth and beyond to the point that the Traditions and Technocracy had to team up, the Traditions and Technocracy are not going to be in a great shape.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-25T21:48:45-08:00","id":837387,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/836836-what-would-the-wod-look-like-if-alternate-histories-merged?p=836967#post836967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe we would see a nuclear war betewen Germany and Soviet Union, with a phyrric victory...or the true winner would be a third faction who didn't suffer the wear by the wear. Maybe a lot of Asian people would travel to North and Sourth-america.</div> </div> </div> </div>Doubtful, even if the axis victory didn't involve a conquest of Russia. <br /> <br /> The Soviets lacked the technical knowledge even after the allied victory and resorted to espionage to gain &quot;the bomb&quot;, they got a lot of the rocket scientists though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T02:11:02-08:00","id":837444,"title":"","content":"The Technocracy would look a lot less friendly. I mean, aside from the Nephandi, plenty of Technos thought at the time that the Nazis had the right idea (No doubt some Traditionalists did too).<br /> <br /> There's the same basic issue as with the other alt-histories. Do you want Man in the High Castle style, wildly implausible Nazis in America or do you want something more realistic but less... aesthetically striking. I mean, a game set in a fully realised Germania would be really memorable, a game set in a version of Berlin where the large monuments are all half finshed because there aren't the raw materials available and there's massive discontent from half the city being made homeless to... actually that could be quite cool as well. Forget it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T10:39:42-08:00","id":837657,"title":"","content":"This is a complicated question, not only because there is the issue of how you change our standard history, but how you change supernatural history to go along with it in each of the game lines. The big three game lines are so different that if I were going to make a Nazis won WWII setting, I would do it differently for Vampire, Werewolf, and Mage. If you're into a combined WoD setting you may not like that option. I don't know if realism should be the biggest concern here, if the world were realistic, look at a history book. In making an alternate history, some degree of realism may be needed, but you should also do what you think would be fun.<br /> <br /> Firstly, how WWII turns out. I think that instead of having the entire western world controlled by the Nazis, I would have fascism control mainland Europe only, with the USA along with the UK and the rest of the Anglosphere free from fascist control. Then we can add a twist to those Nazi free areas, for example maybe the USA is more leftist than in the real world, at least in some regards. A huge numbers of communists and sympathizers Europe as it was conquered by Germany and came to the USA. The US and Britain (and Canada, Australia, etc.) have been in a Cold War of sorts with Nazi Europe since the war ended, perhaps in the 1950's, and one of the points of interest in the setting is espionage, just like the Cold War.<br /> <br /> Vampires get along as they always have. Ultimately, they care less about the specifics of human politics and more about how they can exploit things. Most important events in the world of V:tM happened before WWII anyway, so you could basically just adapt vampiric life to the details of the new setting and have that be the end of it. You could make an alternative history of vampires to go along with the world's alternative history - the Lasombra and Tzimisce dominate the Camarilla instead of the Sabbat. Lasombra use the changing politics of Europe to push their social Darwinist ideology and the Tzimisce Nazis conduct experiments as they please. Of course, changes like that would have originate way before WWII. For practical concerns, one major one is that non-white vampires in Europe would have a harder time, maybe more like they would have historically than a game set in the modern era. You could make as many changes as you like or as few. Maybe in this history, electronics aren't quite as advanced and not everybody has a cell phone with a camera, that might take a little pressure off of masquerade concerns.<br /> <br /> In Mage you could go a number of directions. Two big ones I can imagine is that either the Technocracy stood with fascism through the war and helped them to achieve victory, or we have a setting where the Technocracy isn't as powerful. I think that perhaps the later may be more interesting. During WWII, the Technocracy eventually decided to oppose fascism, but were under heavy attacks from the Traditions and Nephandi. The Technocracy lost much of their domination over reality and so we have a more divided consensus, a more mystical world in a sense. Maybe certain weird elements of Nazi paganism are widely popular and as a result work as part of the consensus. Perhaps weird unconventional forms of science are more effective, death rays, mad scientists, and Sons of Ether kind of stuff.<br /> <br /> As for Werewolf, I'm not sure. I don't know how different the state of the environment would be or how much most werewolves would care about the different political landscape. Maybe things haven't changed much at all. I'd have to give it more thought.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-26T12:55:13-08:00","id":837721,"title":"","content":"Now I read a book about that, &quot;Fatherland&quot; by Robert Harris. It explained how could it happened really.<br /> <br /> * III Reich couldn't invade America without traitor within. <br /> <br /> * I suppose Japan would lose the control of China later.<br /> <br /> * If the Axis controll Arabian and the oil wells, the world economy would be different... but the III reich would fail because America would win the technologic race. <br /> <br /> * Have you played &quot;Risk&quot;, the strategy boardgame anytime? Then you will understand to invade and to keep the anexed zones aren't the same on. <br /> <br /> * If the German lose too soldiers, it would be a phyrrhic victory, too weak to resist the subsequent rebellions.<br /> <br /> * The american society would be different, no hippie revolution. The memeber of the Beatles never created a music band. <br /> <br /> * Maybe a civil war in Turkey. Spain and Italy would rebelle againts German. <br /> <br /> * In the end Europe would suffer a horrible demographic crysis (like now in Russia) because nobody want to raise children if there isn't enough wellness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T19:20:49-08:00","id":839619,"title":"","content":"Winning the war is one thing, I don't know if I believe the Axis forces would be able to control the world through the 21st century. So I imagine there would be a lot of chaos and upheaval as nations fall apart, rebuild, then collapse again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},